
<p>Apple Developer News:</p>

<blockquote>
  <p>Apple is making changes to the Taiwan storefront of the App Store,
following discussions with the Taiwan Fair Trade Commission.</p>

<p>As of October 31, 2026, the commission rate for standard Apple
In-App Purchase and paid app transactions will be 26% on the
Taiwan storefront of the App Store on iOS and iPadOS. Currently,
that rate is 30%.</p>
</blockquote>

<p>Well there we go. The App Store in Taiwan — <a href="https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2025/12/apple-announces-changes-to-ios-in-japan/">just like in Japan</a> — is fixed. </p>

